<title>USA: Digital Link to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Digital Link to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Link Corp said Thursday it  has approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Digital Link has about 9,157,000 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Some of the repurchased shares may be used to fund employee benefit plans and the balance will be available for general corporate purposes. No time limit was set for the  program.</p>
</text>
